   "schema:name": "NHANES Participant governed data records",
   "schema:description": "SDC4 data model for National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey (nhanes_blood_pressure) — FAIR Data Demo. Each record is a governed data record conforming to the SDC4 model NHANES Participant (dm-xy8upneajsb8vdcmnve01g6g), published 2026-09-26. The schema is immutable and cited by URL and SHA-256 in dcterms:conformsTo; every leaf of a record may carry one of the reference model's exceptional values in place of its value, the sentinel domain shared by all variables.",
